Third-party work this repository builds on
------------------------------------------

helius-labs/privacy-ring-examples (Helius Labs)
  https://github.com/helius-labs/privacy-ring-examples
  Pinned commit 9e5d69ade7e0c107a2929306d3b758a8969e1089.
  scripts/setup.sh clones it into .tools/ (not part of this repository) and
  builds its swap program, which the swap side of Keeler runs. The lend tests
  include its test-utils/utxo.rs and test-utils/wallet.rs from that checkout
  with #[path]; they are not copied here. These files in this repository are
  adapted from it:
    lend/program/tests/mollusk.rs from test-utils/mollusk.rs
    lend/sdk/src/proof.rs         in part, from swap/xark/sdk/src/proof.rs
  patches/swap.patch is a patch to swap/xark (program features, lock) and
  carries lines of that repository as context.
  That repository carries no licence at the pinned commit. The two adapted
  files, as far as they come from it, and the patch context remain Helius
  Labs' and are not covered by this repository's Apache-2.0 licence.

